\">main entrance (32555, 32679, 7)</a> or by a backdoor tunnel through the <a href=\"#/wiki/Port%20Hope%20Swamp%20Trolls\">Port Hope Swamp Trolls</a> south entrance.<br/>\n</p><p>There's a locked door at -3 containing a room with a chest, used in the quest <a href=\"#/quest/the-thieves-guild-quest\">The Thieves Guild Quest</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>-1 floor</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Smuggler\"><img alt=\"Smuggler\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Smuggler_089a47.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Smuggler\">Smuggler</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">48</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">130</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">60 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-10× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></li>\n<li>0-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Torch\">Torch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Knife\">Knife</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Short%20Sword\">Short Sword</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Leather Helmet (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\